{"id":"nature","lemma":"nature","pos":"adj","rank":901,"glosses":["plain, unseasoned","condomless, bareback, raw dog, natural (see Thesaurus:condomless)"],"ipa":"/na.tyʁ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/c/ce/Fr-nature.ogg/Fr-nature.ogg.mp3","forms":{"plural":"natures"},"formAudio":{"natures":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f1/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Poslovitch-natures.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"J'aime la nature.","en":"I love the outdoors.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to love","l":"aimer"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"Elle a une bonne nature.","en":"She is good-natured.","words":[{"g":"she / it"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"good","l":"bon"},null]},{"text":"La nature est pleine de mystère.","en":"Nature is full of mystery.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"full, full up","l":"plein"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"mystery"}]},{"text":"Quelle est la nature de votre urgence ?","en":"What's the nature of your emergency?","words":[{"g":"which?"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"your, belonging to you"},{"g":"emergency, urgency"}]},{"text":"Il veut vivre plus près de la nature.","en":"He wants to live closer to nature.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to want, wish, desire","l":"vouloir"},{"g":"to live"},{"g":"more / no longer"},null,null,{"g":"the / her"},null],"phrases":[[4,6,"close to, near."]]}]}